cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AnnotateR"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Das
    given-names: Jyotirmoy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5649-4658"
  - family-names: Volpe
    given-names: Massimiliano
repository-code: "https://github.com/pyrevo/annotater"
abstract: >-
  Genomic coordinate annotation tool: annotate query coordinates
  (BED/VCF/tabular) against annotation features (GFF/GTF/BED/tabular)
  with a web interface. Bedtools and Polars-Bio are interchangeable
  execution backends producing identical canonical results for overlap,
  contains, within, and closest matching, with optional minimum-overlap
  and strand-aware filtering.
keywords:
  - genomics
  - interval annotation
  - bedtools
  - polars-bio
  - streamlit
